# Local settings. Put the aityx ones in the repository's root .env (see
# ../.env.example): start-all.sh links this folder's .env to it. A real file
# here instead is read the same way, for settings of this demo only. In a
# codespace the key comes from your Codespaces secret instead.

# aityx.ai (https://aityx.ai/docs): the API key, from the console's API
# keys page; the same key as Mortgage Hub's and Contact Hub's. A secret: only the API reads
# it, and it must never reach the Flutter app (anything compiled in is
# readable in the web bundle). Every decision at the table needs it.
AITYX_API_KEY=
# The API's base URL. Empty: https://api.aityx.ai, the one the docs name.
# A stage key (from https://console-stage.aityx.ai) works only on stage:
# AITYX_URL=https://api-stage.aityx.ai
AITYX_URL=
